        "content": "<div style=\"background:linear-gradient(180deg,#1b263b 0%,#0d1b2a 100%);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;height:calc(100% - 44px)\">\n  <h3 style=\"color:#e0e1dd;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;border-bottom:1px solid #415a77;padding-bottom:10px\">&#x1F4CA; Dashboards Operationnels</h3>\n  \n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">\n    <a href=\"/d/industrial-control-center\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">\n      <div style=\"background:rgba(233,69,96,0.1);padding:14px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #e94560;margin-bottom:2px\">\n        <h4 style=\"color:#e94560;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:14px\">Industrial Control Center</h4>\n        <p style=\"color:#a0a0a0;margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px\">Centre de controle temps reel de l'infrastructure OT/IT. Vue executive avec indicateurs OEE, disponibilite, performance et qualite.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n          <span style=\"background:#e94560;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">TEMPS REEL</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">OEE</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">SCADA</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">ALERTES</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">\n    <a href=\"/d/unified-business-tech\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">\n      <div style=\"background:rgba(0,212,170,0.1);padding:14px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #00d4aa\">\n        <h4 style=\"color:#00d4aa;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:14px\">Unified Business-Tech View</h4>\n        <p style=\"color:#a0a0a0;margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px\">Vue unifiee combinant KPIs metier et metriques techniques. Correlation entre performance business et sante infrastructure.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n          <span style=\"background:#00d4aa;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">KPIs BUSINESS</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">QUALITE</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">PRODUCTION</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">INFRA</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div>\n    <a href=\"/d/realtime-streaming\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">\n      <div style=\"background:rgba(255,193,7,0.1);padding:14px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #ffc107\">\n        <h4 style=\"color:#ffc107;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:14px\">Real-time Streaming Analytics</h4>\n        <p style=\"color:#a0a0a0;margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px\">Analyse en streaming des flux de donnees. Visualisation live Kafka, debit evenementiel et sante des pipelines.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n          <span style=\"background:#ffc107;color:black;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">STREAMING</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">KAFKA</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">EVENTS/SEC</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">LIVE</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>",
