        "content": "<div style=\"background:linear-gradient(180deg,#1b263b 0%,#0d1b2a 100%);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;height:calc(100% - 44px)\">\n  <h3 style=\"color:#e0e1dd;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;border-bottom:1px solid #415a77;padding-bottom:10px\">&#x1F527; Dashboards Techniques</h3>\n  \n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">\n    <a href=\"/d/system-health-overview\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">\n      <div style=\"background:rgba(83,109,254,0.1);padding:14px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #536dfe\">\n        <h4 style=\"color:#536dfe;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:14px\">System Health Overview</h4>\n        <p style=\"color:#a0a0a0;margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px\">Monitoring complet de la sante systeme. Statut des services, utilisation CPU/memoire/disque et metriques reseau.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n          <span style=\"background:#536dfe;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">INFRASTRUCTURE</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">SERVICES</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">RESSOURCES</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">\n    <a href=\"/d/pipeline-health\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">\n      <div style=\"background:rgba(255,87,34,0.1);padding:14px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #ff5722\">\n        <h4 style=\"color:#ff5722;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:14px\">OOVMTEL Pipeline Health</h4>\n        <p style=\"color:#a0a0a0;margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px\">Sante du pipeline d'observabilite. Monitoring des collecteurs OTEL, brokers Kafka et taux d'ingestion storage.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n          <span style=\"background:#ff5722;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">PIPELINE</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">OTEL</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">KAFKA</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">INGESTION</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div>\n    <a href=\"/d/ai-observability\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">\n      <div style=\"background:rgba(156,39,176,0.1);padding:14px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #9c27b0\">\n        <h4 style=\"color:#9c27b0;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:14px\">AI Observability Hub</h4>\n        <p style=\"color:#a0a0a0;margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px\">Hub d'observabilite IA/ML. Monitoring des workloads d'inference, latence des modeles et metriques de performance.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n          <span style=\"background:#9c27b0;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">IA/ML</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">INFERENCE</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">LATENCE</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#415a77;color:white;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px\">MODELES</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>",
